OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fmainly dry with clear periods this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight. A few showers
OL,8,Fcontinuing across Argyll and the Clyde
OL,9,Fcoast through the night. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,12,Fand a few well scattered showers,
OL,13,Falthough the south starting off dry.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,16,Fdry over the weekend although a few
OL,17,Fshowers possible across Argyll. Rain
OL,18,Flikely to spread northeast on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
